<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-AUSTRALIA BEAT GLASGOW-EDINBURGH 37-19.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-AUSTRALIA BEAT GLASGOW-EDINBURGH 37-19.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1996-11-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia beat a combined</p>
<p>Glasgow-Edinburgh side 37-19 (halftime 15-9) in the second match</p>
<p>of their tour of Britain and Ireland on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Australia - Tries: Mark Connors, David Knox, David Campese,</p>
<p>Daniel Manu, Dave Wilson. Penalties: Knox (2). Conversions: Knox</p>
<p>(3). </p>
<p>Scotland - Try: Kenny Logan. Penalties: Ally Donaldson (4).</p>
<p>Conversion: Donaldson.</p>
</text>
